SUMMARY:GitHub Copilot Dev Days
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\n[GitHub Copilot Dev Days](https://c
 opilot-dev-days.github.io/) was a series of community-led events organized
  around the world\, dedicated to the future of AI-powered development with
  GitHub Copilot.\n\nNow\, this experience is coming to an online edition f
 ocused on modern workflows\, agentic development\, and hands-on experience
 s with AI in VS Code.\n\n**Agentic Development with GitHub Copilot and Typ
 eScript**\n\nIn this hands-on workshop\, you will learn how to build a mod
 ern application using TypeScript\, React\, and Tailwind while exploring th
 e potential of GitHub Copilot as an active agent in the development lifecy
 cle. Beyond autocomplete\, we will dive into VS Code Agent Mode to underst
 and how to guide AI through context engineering and agentic workflows.\n\n
 **[GitHub Copilot Dev Days 2026 – Community Event Kit](https://aka.ms/de
 vdays/workshop)**\n\n| Time (PT) | Session Title | Speaker |\n| --------- 
 | ------------- | ------- |\n| 9:05 AM | Intro and Welcome | Matt Soucoup 
 |\n| 9:25 AM | GitHub Copilot: Your AI Companion for Every Workflow | Matt
  Soucoup |\n| 9:55 AM | Less // TODO: more done with GitHub Copilot CLI | 
 Julia Muiruri |\n| 10:25 AM | What's New in VS Code: Remote\, Permissions 
 & BYOK | Justin Chen + Vritant Bhardwaj |\n| 10:55 AM | Boost Productivity
  with Copilot in Visual Studio | Wendy Breiding |\n| 11:45 AM | Build with
  the Copilot CLI - Mona Mayhem | Ayan Gupta |
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3149
 64144/
