SUMMARY:GitHub Copilot - Understanding Budgets [AMER/EMEA]
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThis session helps customers confid
 ently adopt usage-based billing in GitHub by showing how to plan\, govern\
 , and control spend using built-in budget capabilities.\n\nWe walk through
  how usage-based billing translates into AI credit consumption\, then conn
 ect that to a layered budget model spanning enterprise\, cost center\, and
  user-level controls.\n\nBy the end\, participants will understand how to 
 set the right guardrails\, monitor usage\, and prevent runaway costs while
  still enabling teams to scale AI-powered workflows effectively.\n\nThis s
 ession is appropriate for GitHub Copilot Administrators and development le
 aders.\n\n[Learn about the Token Optimization session here](https://develo
 per.microsoft.com/reactor/events/27228/?wt.mc_id=meetup_27227_webpage_reac
 tor)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3148
 52073/
